sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Component
    participant NostrService
    participant ErrorHandler
    participant ToastSystem
    participant ErrorBoundary

    User->>Component: Interact (publish, subscribe, connect)
    Component->>NostrService: Service Call

    alt Success Path
        NostrService-->>Component: Success Response
        Component-->>User: Update UI
    else Recoverable Error
        NostrService-->>ErrorHandler: Error Event
        ErrorHandler->>ToastSystem: Display Error Toast
        ToastSystem-->>User: Show notification
        User->>ToastSystem: Click Retry
        ToastSystem->>ErrorHandler: Trigger Retry
        ErrorHandler->>NostrService: Retry Operation
        NostrService-->>Component: Retry Response
    else Critical Error
        NostrService-->>ErrorBoundary: Unhandled Exception
        ErrorBoundary->>ErrorBoundary: Catch Error
        ErrorBoundary-->>User: Show Fallback UI
        User->>ErrorBoundary: Click Recover
        ErrorBoundary->>Component: Reset State
        Component-->>User: Reload UI
    end

    Note over ErrorHandler,ToastSystem: Error Classification
    ErrorHandler->>ErrorHandler: Classify Error Type
    ErrorHandler->>ErrorHandler: Determine Severity
    ErrorHandler->>ErrorHandler: Add Troubleshooting Hints
    ErrorHandler->>ToastSystem: Send Enhanced Error

    Note over ToastSystem: Toast Management
    ToastSystem->>ToastSystem: Queue Toast
    ToastSystem->>ToastSystem: Apply Auto-dismiss Timer
    ToastSystem-->>User: Animate Toast In
    ToastSystem->>ToastSystem: Wait for Timeout/User Action
    ToastSystem-->>User: Animate Toast Out
